# Company memory

For tasks touching **more than one product**, fleet agents, or “what happened to X project?”:

1. Open [`docs/COMPANY_MEMORY_INDEX.md`](../../docs/COMPANY_MEMORY_INDEX.md) first.
2. Open root [`ARCHITECTURE.md`](../../ARCHITECTURE.md) and the specific product doc.
3. For V-Voyager / rompler VST context: [`docs/products/VOYAGER_VST.md`](../../docs/products/VOYAGER_VST.md).

Do not assume prior chat sessions retained business context — persist decisions in docs and RAG corpus.
